{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Billy's basketball team scored the following points over the course of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> games of the season. If his team scores <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/94863e76ecdc8d022ada5485b686d9459796dc6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> game, which of the following statistics will show an increase?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c24d4c07e2a72cf04fa5c16f6d7ec90faad13b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[42, 47, 53, 53, 58, 58, 58, 61, 64, 65, 73\\]\" width=\"279\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/0079f381ca0d95a5c0369d86bd6d11513e79b7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\text{range} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\text{median} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\text{mean} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\text{mode} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{mid-range}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"550\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When they score a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> on the next game, the range increases from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53829121e4db503765f4cbc4e39830ebab6231ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73-42=31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66ec4fbbbfc9f714b879059d5ce112213fd6db3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73-40=33$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" />.  This means the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a47553444f56566c4ff3ee7c4db868c630fd44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\text{range}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" /> increased.\n</p><p>Note: The range is defined to be the difference of the largest element and the smallest element of a set.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is less than the score of every game they've played so far, the measures of center will never rise. Only measures of spread, such as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dd28d4bb53ae08205cbe5f4bf5e9c44c7727e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}~\\text{range}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\" />, may increase.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CRITICALLY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CRITICALLY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3_D17-g3K-M\">https://youtu.be/3_D17-g3K-M</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QyBp_12cdGo&amp;list=PL9t_YdPye18V_epxUUbwHTQNeHYBo7a1-&amp;index=9&amp;ab_channel=WhyMath\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QyBp_12cdGo&amp;list=PL9t_YdPye18V_epxUUbwHTQNeHYBo7a1-&amp;index=9&amp;ab_channel=WhyMath</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=